        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DSB4NB Deltana 4 x 4 x Square Corners Non-Removable Pin for Security and 2 Ball Bearing Solid Brass Hinges</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #12 x 1-1/4\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, Non-removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB4NB-specifcations.gif?v=1704354772\" width=\"600\" height=\"279\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSB4NB Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 4 Inch Brass Hinges with Ball Bearings:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Non-Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Dual Ball-Bearing: 2BB</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.129\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #12 x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB4NB-soecifications.pdf?v=1691095358\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSB4NB Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a> for this hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDon't forget to look at <a href=\"/collections/deltana-brass-hinge-finials\">Deltana's Brass Hinge Finials</a> to spice up your hinges!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 x 4 x Square Corners, Solid Brass Hinges with Non-Removable Pin and Ball Bearings, Pair, DSB4NB",
                "description": "Deltana DSB4NB 4 x 4 Solid Brass Hinge, Square Corners, Non Removable Pin with 2 Ball Bearings Hinge. DSB4NB. Heavy Duty 0.129 thick. Package includes a pair of hinges, matching solid brass flathead, Phillips screws and standard removable button tip finials. Available in 9 different finishes",
